/* 轉輪鏡：左右拖 9px＝1 年；點左半／右半各退進 1 年（只用手指點的人也能調） */
function ffDialWire(){
  var m=document.getElementById("ffMirror");if(!m||!m.classList.contains("dial"))return;
  var sx=null,acc=0,moved=0;
  function setY(y){y=Math.max(1940,Math.min(new Date().getFullYear(),y));if(y===STATE.data.year)return;STATE.data.year=y;if(STATE.data.day&&STATE.data.day>ffDaysIn(y,STATE.data.month))STATE.data.day=null;var t=m.querySelector(".ff-ticks");if(t)t.outerHTML=ffDialTicks(m.clientWidth-20,y);var e=document.getElementById("ffDialY");if(e)e.textContent=y;var mm=document.getElementById("ffDialM");if(mm)mm.textContent="民國 "+(y-1911);}
  m.addEventListener("pointerdown",function(e){sx=e.clientX;acc=0;moved=0;try{m.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);}catch(x){}});
  m.addEventListener("pointermove",function(e){if(sx===null)return;var dx=e.clientX-sx;sx=e.clientX;acc+=dx;moved+=Math.abs(dx);var step=Math.trunc(acc/9);if(step){acc-=step*9;setY(STATE.data.year+step);}});
  m.addEventListener("pointerup",function(e){if(sx===null)return;if(moved<4){var r=m.getBoundingClientRect();setY(STATE.data.year+((e.clientX-r.left)<r.width/2?-1:1));}sx=null;});
  m.addEventListener("pointercancel",function(){sx=null;});
}

