/* 付款後完整解讀：網頁版直接在頁內載入呈現（LINE LIFF 仍走 delivery 頁，兩面依登入介面分開） */
function mdFull(t){
  if(!t)return"";
  var out=[],buf=[];
  function flush(){if(buf.length){out.push('<p>'+buf.join('<br>')+'</p>');buf=[];}}
  esc(t).split('\n').forEach(function(line){
    var l=line.trim(),m;
    if(!l){flush();return;}
    if(m=l.match(/^#{1,2}\s*(.+)$/)){flush();out.push('<div class="fi-h1">'+m[1]+'</div>');return;}
    if(m=l.match(/^#{3,6}\s*(.+)$/)){flush();out.push('<div class="fi-h2">'+m[1]+'</div>');return;}
    if(/^-{3,}$/.test(l)){flush();out.push('<hr class="fi-hr">');return;}
    l=l.replace(/^(&gt;\s*)+/,''); /* 2026-09-26：LLM 偶爾用 markdown 引言「> 」，之前原樣印出成一個 > 字 */
    buf.push(l.replace(/\*\*(.+?)\*\*/g,'<strong>$1</strong>').replace(/\*(.+?)\*/g,'$1'));
  });
  flush();
  return out.join('');
}
function loadFullContent(retry){
  var R=STATE.result||{};
  if(!R.purchased||STATE.full||(STATE.fullLoading&&!retry))return;
  var m=(R.deliveryUrl||"").match(/[?&]token=([A-Za-z0-9]+)/);
  if(!m)return;
  STATE.fullLoading=true;STATE.fullError=false;STATE.fullGenerating=false;STATE.fullToken=m[1];
  fetch(WORKER_API+"/delivery-content?token="+m[1],{headers:authHeaders()}).then(function(r){return r.json();}).then(function(d){
    STATE.fullLoading=false;
    if(d&&d.ok&&d.hexagram_content){STATE.full=d;STATE.fullGenerating=false;}
    else if(d&&d.ok&&!d.summary_mode){
      /* Paid 但解讀還在生成（press/gift 免費解鎖＝fulfillPaidOrder 背景履約，LLM 要幾十秒）→ 輪詢等它寫完，不是失敗 */
      STATE.fullPolls=(STATE.fullPolls||0)+1;
      if(STATE.fullPolls<=20){STATE.fullGenerating=true;setTimeout(function(){STATE.fullLoading=false;loadFullContent(true);},6000);}
      else{STATE.fullError=true;}
    }
    else{STATE.fullError=true;}
    if(STATE.step==="result")render();
  }).catch(function(){STATE.fullLoading=false;STATE.fullError=true;if(STATE.step==="result")render();});
}
